# The image build (image/Dockerfile, context = repo root) needs only these.
# Everything else stays out of the build context.
*
!image/
!src/amnesia-search.html
!src/og.png
!src/fonts/

# The ClusterFuzzLite build (.clusterfuzzlite/Dockerfile, context = repo root)
# also runs from this context: it COPYs build.sh, which runs `npm ci` and
# compiles fuzz/*.fuzz.js, which import the Worker source. The fuzz build
# fails without these entries; cflite.yml builds it on every PR that touches
# this file or .clusterfuzzlite/. Safe for the image: image/Dockerfile
# COPYs its files explicitly, so none of this reaches the shipped image.
!.clusterfuzzlite/
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!fuzz/
!worker/src/
